 "findings": [
  "The 2026-09-28 read is 30.0 s late: solved over the rebuild's monitor and mask plays, audio minus game is 29.754 s (18 anchor onsets agree, spread 0.084 s; the best other offset has 12), and the wall clock puts game 0 at audio 29.661-36.137 s, which the old offset (-0.246 s) is outside.",
  "On the corrected clock the opening's monitor and mask sounds land on the rebuild's own plays (2.53, 3.43, 4.13, 4.88, 5.43 s), which the old read had before the capture began.",
  "The '40.0 s' Balloon Boy hops are at 10.04 (echo4b), 15.08 (echo3b) and 20.04 s (echo3b): the echo templates fire four times in the night, every time 0.04-0.08 s after a 5 s roll, so each is a hop vocal; silence is uninformative (four heard of about 41 in the model).",
  "The rebuild agrees with the phone on the echo3b and vent bang at 20.0 s and the vent bangs at 25.0, 30.3, 45.0 and 65.0 s, but it moves Balloon Boy CAM 10 to 7 at 10.0 s, a hop g413 gives no sound, and plays echo1 at 15.03. A hop vocal at 10.04 needs Balloon Boy past CAM 10 by the 10 s roll: on the phone his first roll, at 5 s, already succeeded. That is the earliest state difference this capture shows, at or before the night's first Balloon Boy roll."
 ],
